//! Query system module root — demand-driven compilation with memoization.
//!
//! The query system is the orchestration backbone of the TML compiler pipeline.
//! Each compilation stage (ReadSource → Tokenize → Parse → Typecheck → HirLower →
//! ThirLower → MirBuild → CodegenUnit) is a query that is computed once and cached.
//!
//! Phase 17a — item 1.1.

